# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# The repo root is the public web root, so anything committed here is served
# unless it is blocked. Cloudflare Pages DOES serve dot-directories — verified
# 2026-09-09, when .github/scripts/fb_post.py returned HTTP 200 on the live
# site. These rules 404 the internal tooling directories.
#
# Order matters: first match wins.

/.github/*    /404.html   404
/responder/*  /404.html   404
/scripts/*    /404.html   404
/migrations/* /404.html   404
